	(footprint "sao-plus-plus:SAOPP_MCU-01_Seeed_XIAO_SMD_C3_S3_C6"
		(layer "B.Cu")
		(uuid "40125fa1-7bad-4b49-be30-84e9cdcbe712")
		(at 181.542203 111.856594 90)
		(descr "Seeed Studio XIAO module soldered flat (castellated edges), for XIAO ESP32-C3, ESP32-S3 or ESP32-C6. Edge pads 1-14 are identical on all three: 1-7 = D0..D6, 8-11 = D7..D10, 12 = 3V3, 13 = GND, 14 = 5V (pads 1 and 14 are at the USB end). Battery pads under the module are in DIFFERENT places: pads 15 (BAT+) and 16 (BAT-) are each drawn twice, once where the C3 and S3 have them and once where the C6 has them. Neither position touches copper on the other modules. The circles on Dwgs.User mark the module's other underside test pads (their signals differ per module): keep carrier copper out. USB-C is at -Y and overhangs the module by 1.5 mm: put that end at the board edge. Source: Seeed OPL_Kicad_Library footprints.")
		(tags "SAO++ Seeed XIAO ESP32 C3 S3 C6 module castellated")
